OL,3,GNEWSAAdventurer Karl Bushby names date
OL,4,Afor Channel swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British adventurer says he has
OL,7,Fpermission from French authorities to
OL,8,Fswim the English Channel, enabling him
OL,9,Fto finish his 28-year journey.
OL,11,FKarl Bushby, 57, set off from Chile in
OL,12,F1998 and has reached Belgium. Under the
OL,13,Fterms of the challenge he has set
OL,14,Fhimself he is unable to use transport
OL,15,Fto reach his home city of Hull.
OL,17,FThe former British Army paratrooper and
OL,18,Fson of an SAS soldier said he expected
OL,19,Fto take to the water on 1 October,
OL,20,Ftides and weather permitting.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
