OL,3,GNEWSAAdventurer Karl Bushby names date
OL,4,Afor Channel swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FBushby, who this summer was refused
OL,7,Faccess to the Channel Tunnel which
OL,8,Fwould have avoided having to navigate
OL,9,Fone of the world's busiest shipping
OL,10,Froutes, said: "I'm really pleased the
OL,11,Fplan is coming together."
